# Local runtime state — never commit these.
# The live clipboard database lives in $XDG_DATA_HOME/copyous@local/, but a
# stray copy can appear in the extension directory (e.g. DEBUG_COPYOUS_DBPATH).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
clipboard.json
custom-theme.css

# Phase evidence for this maintenance fork: PROFILE/AUDIT/PLAN/STATE/REVIEW under
# docs/reports/. This repo is public and those files quote raw journal lines, live
# dconf values and the on-disk layout of the plaintext clipboard store, so they
# stay local-only. The pattern matches the directory at any depth.
reports/
